  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land Cadastre</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Landregister</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att uppr&#xe4;tta ett landregister inom ramen f&#xf6;r Tadzjikistans land reform. St&#xf6;det kommer att koncentrereas till institutions- och kompetensutveckling av det statliga lantm&#xe4;teriet, som &#xe4;r en nyckelinstitution i detta reformsammanhang.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aimed at the establishment of a modern land cadastre system in the context of Tajikistan&apos;s land reform. The focus of support will be on institutional- and competence development of the State Land Committee (SLC), which is at the core of the reform process.</narrative>
  </description>
